# Lost for Words (Windurst 2-1): Windurst Woods. A level 10 Warrior of Windurst who has completed 1-1, 1-2 and 1-3 (a
# GM). Section 1: Rakoh Buuma plays 114; its finish with option 3 begins the mission. Section 2 (2-1 current): Miiri-
# Wohri, Rakoh Buuma and Sola Jaab play 161, 160 and 162; Tih Pikeh plays progress event 163, whose finish makes the
# next 164, whose finish makes the next 163 again. Completed (no mission, A Testing Time not completed): Miiri-Wohri,
# Sola Jaab and Tih Pikeh play 118, 117 and 119.
# Rival zone-in: entering Windurst Woods plays the Seekers of Adventure mission Rumors from the West, 839 (another
# mission's script, not this one); its finish writes that mission's status 4 (area 12).
